/Title (Jet\055images\040\204\040deep\040learning\040edition)
/Author (Luke\040de\040Oliveira\054\040Michael\040Kagan\054\040Lester\040Mackey\054\040Benjamin\040Nachman\054\040Ariel\040Schwartzman)
/Subject (Building\040on\040the\040notion\040of\040a\040particle\040physics\040detector\040as\040a\040camera\040and\040the\040collimated\040streams\040of\040high\040energy\040particles\054\040or\040jets\054\040it\040measures\040as\040an\040image\054\040we\040investigate\040the\040potential\040of\040machine\040learning\040techniques\040based\040on\040deep\040learning\040architectures\040to\040identify\040highly\040boosted\040W\040bosons\056\040Modern\040deep\040learning\040algorithms\040trained\040on\040jet\040images\040can\040out\055perform\040standard\040physically\055motivated\040feature\040driven\040approaches\040to\040jet\040tagging\056\040We\040develop\040techniques\040for\040visualizing\040how\040these\040features\040are\040learned\040by\040the\040network\040and\040what\040additional\040information\040is\040used\040to\040improve\040performance\056\040This\040interplay\040between\040physicallymotivated\040feature\040driven\040tools\040and\040supervised\040learning\040algorithms\040is\040general\040and\040can\040be\040used\040to\040significantly\040increase\040the\040sensitivity\040to\040discover\040new\040particles\040and\040new\040forces\054\040and\040gain\040a\040deeper\040understanding\040of\040the\040physics\040within\040jets\056)
